--- !u!114 &2140103244
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2140103242}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 70c7cc5d303454b34ad9b8be327728bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Hacking.HackableObstacle
  encounterTitle: leo_last_summer.mem  //  CORRUPTED
  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e5025d89b1fb4739baa98f9dfeeada6, type: 2}
  introLines:
  - 'ACCESSING: leo_last_summer.mem'
  - 'THIS FILE IS 94% PAIN. RECOMMENDED ACTION: DELETE.'
  - '* My handheld trembles. If I want to understand this file, I have to read it
    myself.'
  waves:
  - pattern: 6
    duration: 9
    intensity: 1
    surrender: 0
  - pattern: 11
    duration: 9
    intensity: 1.05
    surrender: 0
  - pattern: 8
    duration: 9
    intensity: 1.1
    surrender: 0
  - pattern: 9
    duration: 10
    intensity: 1.15
    surrender: 0
  puzzles:
  - prompt: 'FILE HEADER CORRUPTED. The file asks you one thing: why did you leave
      home?'
    options:
    - '[FOR A BETTER JOB]'
    - '[I''M NOT SURE ANYMORE]'
    - '[I THOUGHT THEY''D BE BETTER OFF WITHOUT ME]'
    correctIndex: 2
    correctLine: The header repairs itself. It wasn't the job. It was never the job.
    wrongLine: 'THE ALGORITHM: ''THE OFFICIAL STORY. I APPROVE.'' It''s what you
      tell everyone. The file stays locked.'
    hint: The Algorithm loves tidy excuses, the kind you'd put on a form. The file
      only opens for something true, even 'I don't know'.
    altCorrectIndex: 1
    altCorrectLine: '''Not sure.'' The file accepts that: honesty is a key too. The
      header repairs itself and shows what you couldn''t say. {p}You thought they''d
      be better off without you.'
  - prompt: 'A phone buzzes inside the memory. The screen reads: <color=#FF4FD8>MIA
      (my little sister) - 14 missed calls</color>. Who have you been avoiding?'
    options:
    - '[THE OFFICE]'
    - '[NOBODY. NOBODY EVER CALLS.]'
    - '[MIA. MY SISTER.]'
    correctIndex: 2
    correctLine: 'A voicemail plays, crackling: ''Leo? It''s okay if you can''t come.
      ...Can you come?'''
    wrongLine: The phone in the memory keeps ringing. You know who it is. You just
      don't want to.
    hint: Look at the phone in the memory again. The name is right there on the screen.
    altCorrectIndex: -1
    altCorrectLine: 
  - prompt: Fourteen missed calls. Why haven't you called back?
    options:
    - '[EVERY DAY OF SILENCE MADE THE CALL HEAVIER]'
    - '[THEY''RE MAD AT ME]'
    - '[I''M TOO BUSY]'
    correctIndex: 0
    correctLine: Every unanswered day stacked on the last, like boxes. Fourteen of
      them.
    wrongLine: The excuse dissolves as soon as you say it.
    hint: 'Nobody ever said they were mad, and you''re not busy: you''re on a ghost
      train. Think of the boxes in your apartment, piling up a little more every
      day.'
    altCorrectIndex: -1
    altCorrectLine: 
  - prompt: 'THE ALGORITHM: ''DEFINE THE STATIC.'''
    options:
    - '[A MALFUNCTION]'
    - '[NOISE]'
    - '[THE PART OF ME THAT STILL CARES]'
    correctIndex: 2
    correctLine: The static isn't damage. It's a signal. It's the part of you that's
      still trying to call home.
    wrongLine: 'THE ALGORITHM: ''CORRECT. LET ME CLEAN IT.'' ...No. That''s not it.'
    hint: The Algorithm wants you to call it a defect so it can delete it. What has
      that static in your chest been doing all night? It's been pulling you somewhere.
    altCorrectIndex: -1
    altCorrectLine: 
  resolutionLines:
  - ERROR. ERROR. EMOTION CANNOT BE COMPRESSED FURTHER.
  - WHY... DOES IT HURT LESS, NOW THAT YOU HAVE READ IT?
  portraitTarget: {fileID: 442474591}
  portraitDistance: 7
  betweenRoundLines:
  - HEADER RESTORED. ...YOU ARE READING IT ANYWAY. INEFFICIENT.
  - AUDIO RECOVERED. THIS VOICE INCREASES YOUR HEART RATE. I DO NOT UNDERSTAND.
  - THE BOXES. FOURTEEN OF THEM. YOU PACKED SILENCE AND CALLED IT MOVING ON.
  tauntLines:
  - FRICTION DETECTED.
  - WHY DO YOU KEEP IT?
  - DELETING IS EASIER.
  - YOU COULD JUST STOP FEELING.
  - EFFICIENCY IS KINDNESS.
  - 3 YEARS. 0 REPLIES.
  - SHE STOPPED CALLING, LEO.
  musicOverride: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13c79bf98c0aa475b983d3c87afc4a8a, type: 3}
  fadeCompanion: 0
  companionLabel: byte
  requiredFlag: algorithm_met
  lockedLines:
  - '* A floating box behind a wall of light. Something tells me to face whatever''s
    at the end of this room first.'
  flagOnResolved: core_file_read
  hideOnResolved: []
  showOnResolved: []
  dissolveColor: {r: 1, g: 0.75, b: 0.45, a: 1}
  promptAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  onResolved:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
